#. Lokalise key 18732578; source translation 99343035; Swedish translation 118213282; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"appstore.app.description\",\"18732578\"]"
msgid ""
"Control and monitor your home from anywhere in the world. Home Assistant Companion lets you control all your devices and provides advanced location and notification engines to allow for complex mobile automations.\n"
"\n"
"Home Assistant is an open-source home automation platform that focuses on local control and privacy. Supported products include:\n"
"\n"
"- Amazon Echo (Alexa)\n"
"- Apple TV\n"
"- Arduino\n"
"- Belkin WeMo\n"
"- Dark Sky\n"
"- ecobee\n"
"- Google Assistant\n"
"- Google Cast\n"
"- IFTTT\n"
"- IKEA Trådfri (Tradfri)\n"
"- Kodi/XBMC\n"
"- MQTT\n"
"- MySensors\n"
"- Nest\n"
"- Owntracks\n"
"- Philips Hue\n"
"- Plex\n"
"- Pushbullet\n"
"- Sonos\n"
"- Wink\n"
"- Z-Wave\n"
"\n"
"Home Assistant Companion requires an iPhone running iOS 10.3 or later and a configured Home Assistant instance. The instance must use Home Assistant Cloud or be accessible from the Internet and secured with a valid, non self-signed, SSL certificate for location tracking. Basic notifications work without external access."
msgstr ""
"Styr och övervaka ditt hem från var som helst i världen. Home Assistants app låter dig styra alla dina enheter och tillhandahåller avancerade plats- och notis-funktioner för att underlätta komplexa mobilautomatiseringar.\n"
"\n"
"Home Assistant är en öppen källkods-plattform för automatisering, fokuserad på lokal kontroll och sekretess. Produkter som stöds inkluderar:\n"
"\n"
"- Amazon Echo (Alexa)\n"
"- Apple TV\n"
"- Arduino\n"
"- Belkin WeMo\n"
"- Dark Sky\n"
"- ecobee\n"
"- Google Assistent\n"
"- Google Cast\n"
"- IFTTT\n"
"- IKEA Trådfri (Tradfri)\n"
"- Kodi/XBMC\n"
"- MQTT\n"
"- MySensors\n"
"- Nest\n"
"- Owntracks\n"
"- Philips Hue\n"
"- Plex\n"
"- Pushbullet\n"
"- Sonos\n"
"- Wink\n"
"- Z-Wave\n"
"\n"
"Home Assistant-appen kräver en iPhone med iOS 10.3 eller senare och en konfigurerad Home Assistant-installation. Installationen måste använda Home Assistant Cloud eller vara åtkomlig från internet och skyddad med ett giltigt, icke självsignerat, SSL-certifikat för platsspårning. Grundläggande notiser fungerar utan extern åtkomst."

