msgstr "Visa ikonen för att iPhone är otillgänglig"

#. Lokalise key 897885843; source translation 9188328598; Swedish translation 9188328565; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"web_view.empty_state.clean_cache_and_reload_button\",\"897885843\"]"
msgid "Clean cache and reload"
msgstr "Rensa cacheminnet och ladda om sidan"

#. Lokalise key 898891978; source translation 9201021223; Swedish translation 9201021204; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"watch.complications.builder.complication_name\",\"898891978\"]"
msgid "Complication name"
msgstr "Komplikationens namn"

#. Lokalise key 899474992; source translation 9208688373; Swedish translation 9208687397; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"settings.server_switching.by_location.footer\",\"899474992\"]"
msgid "When you open the app, it checks whether you are at one of your homes, either connected to its Wi-Fi network or inside its Home zone. If that home belongs to another server, that server is opened automatically. Checks happen only on this device while the app is in use, and your location is never stored."
msgstr "När du öppnar appen kontrollerar den om du befinner dig i någon av dina bostäder, antingen ansluten till dess Wi-Fi-nätverk eller inom dess hemzon. Om den bostaden tillhör en annan server öppnas den servern automatiskt. Kontrollerna sker endast på den här enheten medan appen används, och din position sparas aldrig."

#. Lokalise key 899474993; source translation 9208688374; Swedish translation 9208687430; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"settings.server_switching.by_location.title\",\"899474993\"]"
msgid "Switch Server by Location"
msgstr "Byt server efter plats"

#. Lokalise key 899474994; source translation 9208688375; Swedish translation 9208687463; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"settings.server_switching.closest_server.title\",\"899474994\"]"
msgid "Closest Server"
msgstr "Närmaste server"

#. Lokalise key 899474995; source translation 9208688376; Swedish translation 9208687496; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"settings.server_switching.how_it_works.intro\",\"899474995\"]"
msgid "With multiple homes, the app can figure out which server matters right now and switch to it for you. Walk into your second home and its dashboard is already there."
msgstr "Om du har flera bostäder kan appen avgöra vilken server som är aktuell just nu och växla till den åt dig. När du kommer hem till din andra bostad är dess kontrollpanel redan öppen."

#. Lokalise key 899474996; source translation 9208688377; Swedish translation 9208687529; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"settings.server_switching.how_it_works.location.body\",\"899474996\"]"
msgid "Otherwise, your location is compared with each server's Home zone, and the nearest one is considered closest."
msgstr "I annat fall jämförs din plats med varje servers hemzon, och den närmaste betraktas som den närmaste."

#. Lokalise key 899474997; source translation 9208688378; Swedish translation 9208687562; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"settings.server_switching.how_it_works.location.title\",\"899474997\"]"
msgid "Then your location"
msgstr "Sedan din plats"

#. Lokalise key 899474998; source translation 9208688379; Swedish translation 9208687595; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"settings.server_switching.how_it_works.privacy.body\",\"899474998\"]"
msgid "Network and location checks happen only on this device, only while the app is in use. Your location is never stored or shared."
