msgstr "Din integritet"

#. Lokalise key 913916340; source translation 9447730397; Swedish translation 9447729572; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"focus.how_it_works.reporting.body\",\"913916340\"]"
msgid "Turning that Focus on runs the filter, and the app sends the name to Home Assistant as the Focus name sensor."
msgstr "När du aktiverar den här funktionen körs filtret, och appen skickar namnet till Home Assistant som sensornamnet ”Fokus”."

