msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Companion for iOS\",\"ios\",\"server_identity.about.fix.body\",\"961381485\"]"
msgid "Give one of the servers a new ID. On the same network Home Assistant offers this in Settings › Repairs. Otherwise remove the file .storage/core.uuid on one server and restart it. Data and configuration are not affected."
